WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.400
I find even to this
day 36 years later,

00:00:03.400 --> 00:00:06.090
I'm in front of the camera, and
I'm suddenly holding my breath.

00:00:09.270 --> 00:00:13.440
In the early part of my career,
I had no idea how to pose.

00:00:13.440 --> 00:00:15.780
I took my dance
background, and I kind of

00:00:15.780 --> 00:00:18.600
incorporated it into posing.

00:00:18.600 --> 00:00:20.640
That's how I really
tried to fake it

00:00:20.640 --> 00:00:21.900
as you make it so to speak.

00:00:26.380 --> 00:00:28.480
I never feel like when
I look in a magazine

00:00:28.480 --> 00:00:29.800
I'm looking at myself.

00:00:29.800 --> 00:00:33.700
I feel like it's a job I
did, yes, but it's not me.

00:00:33.700 --> 00:00:36.280
Join me as I share life
lessons, some of my

00:00:36.280 --> 00:00:38.140
never before told
modeling stories,

00:00:38.140 --> 00:00:42.040
and tips on how to bring
confidence into any room.

00:00:42.040 --> 00:00:46.440
I'm Naomi Campbell, and
this is MasterClass.

